LAYOUT 360DA016
BUILD 12.1.7.70424, 1.60.1.70450
COMMENT PTR 12.1.7 and Classic Beta: 63 fields; no ID list -- the ID is field 0 (18-bit signed, header id_index 0), so every
COMMENT column is one field later than in 6ABF2921; fifteen columns are added before the three arrays. Time's pallet words
COMMENT carry bit 16: it is read at 16 bits (Time<u16>; database.xml declares it uint16), which keeps the value alone.
